                <pb facs="0247" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg135"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 825.001/2.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Vice President of Chile to President
                    Taft.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Government and people of Chile will take grateful knowledge of the telegram
                    in which your excellency deigns to transmit the condolence of the United States
                    in our latest affliction.</p>
                <p>Accept, excellency, my personal gratitude and the sentiments of my highest and
                    most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Emiliano
                    Figueroa.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
